  "description": "MEET THE NEW KID IN CLASS.\nHoleshot! If your looking to pin on some numbers, drop the hammer and get to the first turn first or prefer weekly fun rides with your buddies, Holeshot's size specific blended carbon fiber lay up schedule and contemporary XC geometry has been expertly tuned for class leading performance.\nHoleshot offers generous tire clearance up to 29x2.4, SRAM's new Universal Derailleur Hanger and happily accepts 100mm or 120mm suspension forks - oh and let's not forget the clean cable routing.\nIf you aspire to be on the top step or achieve your personal best on your local loop Holeshot's game to get dirty with ya.",
